WEBVTT

00:03:27.871 --> 00:03:30.954
to allow DNA to get copied 
every time a cell divides

00:03:30.996 --> 00:03:33.788
without damaging
the cell’s genetic code,

00:03:33.829 --> 00:03:36.788
and they shorten
with each cell division.

00:03:37.413 --> 00:03:43.079
When telomeres become too short,
a cell can no longer divide and it dies.

00:03:43.371 --> 00:03:45.163
As if all that weren’t enough,

00:03:45.204 --> 00:03:48.871
chronic stress has even more ways 
it can sabotage your health,

00:03:48.913 --> 00:03:51.413
including acne, hair loss,

00:03:51.454 --> 00:03:55.079
sexual dysfunction, headaches,
muscle tension,

00:03:55.121 --> 00:04:00.246
difficulty concentrating,
fatigue, and irritability.